value        Object(v) === v  Object(v) returns    so it is   type
undefined    false            a new empty object   primitive  Undefined
null         false            a new empty object   primitive  Null
true         false            a Boolean wrapper    primitive  Boolean
1            false            a Number wrapper     primitive  Number
1n           false            a BigInt wrapper     primitive  BigInt
"s"          false            a String wrapper     primitive  String
Symbol()     false            a Symbol wrapper     primitive  Symbol
{}           true             the same object      object     Object, made by Object
[]           true             the same object      object     Object, made by Array
() => {}     true             the same object      object     Object, made by Function
new Date(0)  true             the same object      object     Object, made by Date
/s/          true             the same object      object     Object, made by RegExp
12 values: 7 primitives, 5 objects
8 types: Undefined, Null, Boolean, Number, BigInt, String, Symbol, Object
